{"info": {"address1": "11/13, Botawala Building", "address2": "1st Floor Office No 2-6 Horniman Circle, Fort", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400001", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6121 8400", "fax": "91 22 6121 8499", "website": "https://www.tataconsumer.com", "industry": "Packaged Foods", "industryKey": "packaged-foods", "industryDisp": "Packaged Foods", "sector": "Consumer Defensive", "sectorKey": "consumer-defensive", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Defensive", "longBusinessSummary": "Tata Consumer Products Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, distributes, and trades in food products in India, the United States, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It operates through Branded Business and Non Branded Business segments. The company provides tea, coffee, water, salt, pulses, spices, snacks, ready-to-eat packaged and processed food products, ready to cook, ready to drink beverages, breakfast cereals, sauces, instant masala noodles, meal solutions, staples, mini-meals, breakfast, chilli ginger garlic paste, cooking aids and condiments, dry fruits, floor and millets, honey, chutneys, and cold-pressed oils. It also offers health supplements; glucose and jelly drinks; juices; food; and out-of-home consumptions products. The company provides its products primarily under the Tata Tea, Tata Tea Premium, Tetley, 1868 by Tata Tea, Organic India, Tata Coffee Grand, Tata Coffee Gold, Tata Coffee Quick Filter, Sonnets by Tata Coffee, Tata Salt, Tata Sampann, Smith & Jones, Tata Soulfull, Himalayan honey and preserves, Ching's Secret, Tata Simply Better, Himalayan water, Tata Copper+, Tata Gluco+, Tata Coffee Grand Cold Coffee, Zip Zap, Tetley Ready-To-Drink Green Tea, Tata Starbucks, Tata Consumer Specialist Solutions, Tata MyBistro, Good Earth, Teapigs, Eight O'Clock, Vitax, Himalayan, Laager, Tea4Kidz, Tea time, Society Coffee, Phendula, Teeco, Southalls, Tata Tea Gold, Kanan Devan, Chakra Gold, Tata Tea Agni, Joekels, Tata Coffee Cold Coffee, Tata Fruski, Tata GoFit, Himalayan Honey & Preserves, Himalayan Saffron, and Tata MyBistro Vending brands. The company was formerly known as Tata Global Beverages Limited and changed its name to Tata Consumer Products Limited in February 2020. Tata Consumer Products Limited was incorporated in 1962 and is based in Mumbai, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 11233, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sunil Alaric D'Souza", "age": 58, "title": "MD, CEO & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2026, "totalPay": 158495000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ajit Sukumar Krishna Kumar", "title": "COO & Executive Director", "fiscalYear": 2026, "totalPay": 50257000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Delnaz Dara Harda", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2026, "totalPay": 7409000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sivakumar  Sivasankaran", "title": "Senior VP & Group Finance Controller & CFO of India", "fiscalYear": 2026, "totalPay": 23425000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Punit  Gupta", "title": "President & Head of Sales for India", "fiscalYear": 2026, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ashish  Goenka", "age": 46, "title": "Group Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2026, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. S. K. Roychaudhuri", "age": 68, "title": "Chief Information Officer and Director of Application Support & Development - Asia Regions", "yearBorn": 1957, "fiscalYear": 2026, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Nidhi  Verma", "title": "Head of Investor Relations & Corporate Communication", "fiscalYear": 2026, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rishi  Gautam", "title": "Global General Counsel", "fiscalYear": 2026, "exercise